From 7fa30a5c6c51daa916d21b4655742810b6fadddb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenCode <opencode@localhost>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 16:13:37 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] wland 0239: fast scan + fresh list on the 0004 stack;
 boot stamp keyed on kern.bootsessionuuid

0232/0233 carried 0005-0018 and the modem went ERR-FATAL 1 s after boot. This drops
0005-0018 (0004 = last stack with working Wi-Fi), renumbers the scan patches to 0005/0006
and fixes the once-per-boot guard: boottime seconds repeat across boots on this phone
(fake 1969 clock), so a boot could refuse to start wland at all.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

